{
  "id": "RUT.3",
  "number": "3",
  "bookId": "RUT",
  "reference": "Ruthu 3",
  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "RUT 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baada ya muda, Naomi mkwewe alimwambia Ruthu, “Ni wajibu wangu kukutafutia mume ili upate mema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sasa huyu Boazi, ambaye ulifanya kazi na wasichana wake, je, si ni wa ukoo wetu? Haya basi sikiliza, jioni hii atakuwa anapura shayiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo, nawa, ujipake manukato na kuvalia vizuri, kisha uende mahali anapopuria; lakini angalia usitambulike kwake mpaka atakapomaliza kula na kunywa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pia, ujue mahali atakapolala, na akisha kusinzia, mwendee polepole uifunue miguu yake ulale papo hapo. Yeye atakueleza la kufanya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruthu akajibu, “Nitafanya yote uliyoniambia.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo, Ruthu alikwenda mahali pa kupuria, akafanya jinsi mama mkwe wake alivyomwamuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boazi alipomaliza kula na kunywa, akafurahi moyoni. Basi alikwenda karibu na tita la shayiri, akalala. Ruthu alikwenda polepole akafunua miguu yake na kulala hapo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Usiku wa manane, Boazi aligutuka, akageuka, akashtuka kumkuta mwanamke amelala miguuni pake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akauliza, “Wewe ni nani?” Ruthu akajibu, “Ni mimi Ruthu, mtumishi wako. Kwa kuwa wewe u jamaa yangu wa karibu, uitande nguo yako juu ya mjakazi wako.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boazi akasema, “Mwenyezi-Mungu na akubariki, kwa maana kwa yote unayofanya unaonesha heshima zaidi kuliko uliyoyafanya hapo awali, kwa maana hukuwatafuta vijana maskini au tajiri wakuoe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sasa binti yangu usifadhaike, nitakufanyia lolote utakaloomba kwa kuwa kila mtu mjini humu anajua wema wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni kweli kwamba ni jukumu langu kukutunza, lakini kuna pia mwenye jukumu la kukutunza na ambaye yu karibu zaidi kuliko mimi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo, kaa hapa usiku wote, na kesho asubuhi tutaona kama atakubali kukutunza au la. Ikiwa atakutunza ni vyema. Akikataa, kwa jina la Mwenyezi-Mungu aliye hai mimi nitakutunza. Lala hapa mpaka asubuhi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi Ruthu akalala hapo miguuni pake mpaka asubuhi, lakini aliamka alfajiri ili asionekane, kwa kuwa Boazi hakutaka mtu ajue kuwa Ruthu alikuwa mahali pa kupuria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boazi akamwambia, “Tandika nguo yako chini.” Ruthu akafanya hivyo. Boazi akamwaga shayiri ipatayo vipimo sita, akamtwika, naye akarudi mjini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alipofika mjini, mkwewe akamwuliza, “Ilikuwaje binti yangu?” Ruthu akamweleza yote ambayo Boazi alimtendea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halafu akaendelea kusema, “Aliniambia nisirudi nyumbani kwa mkwe wangu mikono mitupu na kwa hiyo alinipa shayiri hii ipatayo vipimo sita.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Naomi akasema, “Sasa tulia binti yangu Ruthu, mpaka uone litakalotokea. Boazi hatatulia leo mpaka ameyatimiza yote.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
